n\n### MAKING LEGAL HISTORY MATTER\n\n# Interview with Justin Barry, Jack Sheridan, & Christine Sisario\n\n![Christine Sisario, Justin Barry,
and Jack Sheridan](https://history.nycourts.gov/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/tech-interview-screenshot-2.jpg)\n\n### **Watch the 
